IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgba-nouns`
IMPORT `sgba-vintage`
IMPORT `sgba-sched`
IMPORT `sgba-p1-defs`
IMPORT `sgba-p5-apparatus`

-- Tests for sgba-p5-apparatus.l4 (ss 20 and 21) and the s 2(1) definition of "broadcasting apparatus". Expected values are written from the text of ss 20 and 21,
-- of s 2(1) and of the First Schedule. A test asserts what a provision says, not that any particular person is or is not caught.

§ `Fixtures`

`apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` MEANS Apparatus WITH `capable of reception of a broadcasting service` IS TRUE, `capable of direct reception from a satellite` IS TRUE
`apparatus that can receive but not directly from a satellite` MEANS Apparatus WITH `capable of reception of a broadcasting service` IS TRUE, `capable of direct reception from a satellite` IS FALSE
`apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite but not a broadcasting service` MEANS Apparatus WITH `capable of reception of a broadcasting service` IS FALSE, `capable of direct reception from a satellite` IS TRUE

`does nothing with it` MEANS `Dealing with apparatus` WITH
    `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale` IS FALSE
    `operates it` IS FALSE
    `has it` IS FALSE
    `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person` IS FALSE
    `broadcasting services are received on or by it` IS FALSE

`installs it` MEANS `Dealing with apparatus` WITH
    `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale` IS FALSE
    `operates it` IS FALSE
    `has it` IS FALSE
    `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person` IS FALSE
    `broadcasting services are received on or by it` IS FALSE

`sells it` MEANS `Dealing with apparatus` WITH
    `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale` IS TRUE
    `operates it` IS FALSE
    `has it` IS FALSE
    `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person` IS FALSE
    `broadcasting services are received on or by it` IS FALSE

`has it on own premises and services are received` MEANS `Dealing with apparatus` WITH
    `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale` IS FALSE
    `operates it` IS FALSE
    `has it` IS TRUE
    `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person` IS TRUE
    `broadcasting services are received on or by it` IS TRUE

`has it on own premises but no service is received` MEANS `Dealing with apparatus` WITH
    `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale` IS FALSE
    `operates it` IS FALSE
    `has it` IS TRUE
    `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person` IS TRUE
    `broadcasting services are received on or by it` IS FALSE

§ `s 2(1) "broadcasting apparatus": capable of reception AND specified in the First Schedule`

#ASSERT `s 2(1) the apparatus is broadcasting apparatus on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2(1) the apparatus is broadcasting apparatus on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive but not directly from a satellite` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2(1) the apparatus is broadcasting apparatus on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite but not a broadcasting service` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2(1) the apparatus is broadcasting apparatus on` (Date 24 9 2024) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2(1) the apparatus is broadcasting apparatus on` (Date 1 1 2011) `apparatus that can receive but not directly from a satellite` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2(1) the apparatus is broadcasting apparatus on` (Date 5 11 2026) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 20(1)(a) to (c): what the conduct is, paragraph by paragraph`

#ASSERT `s 20(1)(a) the person installs broadcasting apparatus, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(a) the person installs broadcasting apparatus, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive but not directly from a satellite` `installs it` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(a) the person installs broadcasting apparatus, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `sells it` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(a) the person installs broadcasting apparatus, on` (Date 24 9 2024) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(b) the person imports, offers for sale, sells or has in possession with a view to sale broadcasting apparatus, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `sells it` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(b) the person imports, offers for sale, sells or has in possession with a view to sale broadcasting apparatus, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(b) the person imports, offers for sale, sells or has in possession with a view to sale broadcasting apparatus, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive but not directly from a satellite` `sells it` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(c) the person operates, or has on premises owned or occupied by the person, broadcasting apparatus on or by which broadcasting services are received, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `has it on own premises and services are received` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(c) the person operates, or has on premises owned or occupied by the person, broadcasting apparatus on or by which broadcasting services are received, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `has it on own premises but no service is received` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(c) the person operates, or has on premises owned or occupied by the person, broadcasting apparatus on or by which broadcasting services are received, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive but not directly from a satellite` `has it on own premises and services are received` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(c) the person operates, or has on premises owned or occupied by the person, broadcasting apparatus on or by which broadcasting services are received, on` (Date 5 11 2026) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `has it on own premises and services are received` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 20(1): the three paragraphs together`

#ASSERT `s 20(1) the dealing is within paragraph (a), (b) or (c) of the subsection, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the dealing is within paragraph (a), (b) or (c) of the subsection, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `sells it` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the dealing is within paragraph (a), (b) or (c) of the subsection, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `has it on own premises and services are received` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the dealing is within paragraph (a), (b) or (c) of the subsection, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `has it on own premises but no service is received` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the dealing is within paragraph (a), (b) or (c) of the subsection, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `does nothing with it` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the dealing is within paragraph (a), (b) or (c) of the subsection, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive but not directly from a satellite` `installs it` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the dealing is within paragraph (a), (b) or (c) of the subsection, on` (Date 24 9 2024) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 20(1) "except under and in accordance with a licence", s 20(2)`

#ASSERT `s 20(1) the dealing is under and in accordance with a licence granted under the section` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 20(1) the dealing is under and in accordance with a licence granted under the section` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 20(1) the dealing is under and in accordance with a licence granted under the section` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 20(1) the dealing is under and in accordance with a licence granted under the section` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 20(2) the licence is in the form, for the period and on the terms the Authority determined` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 20(2) the licence is in the form, for the period and on the terms the Authority determined` FALSE)

§ `s 20(3) and (4): the duty-based and Authority exemptions`

#ASSERT `s 20(3) the person is not required by subsection (1) to obtain a licence under this Act` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(3) the person is not required by subsection (1) to obtain a licence under this Act` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 20(4) the person, the apparatus or the class of apparatus is exempt from subsection (1)` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 20(4) the person, the apparatus or the class of apparatus is exempt from subsection (1)` FALSE)

§ `s 20(1) as a whole: contravention, licence and exemption routes`

-- contravenes: within the paragraphs, no licence, no exemption
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `sells it` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `has it on own premises and services are received` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- one route out each: a licence in accordance, s 20(3), s 20(4), s 60(b) order
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- outside the paragraphs, or not broadcasting apparatus
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `does nothing with it` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive but not directly from a satellite` `installs it` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- dates: the window of the deposited text, one day each side
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 25 9 2024) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 24 9 2024) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 1 10 2026) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 5 11 2026) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 31 12 2010) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 2 1 2011) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `installs it` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 20(1)(c): the premises phrase (fork F-BA-03), reading A and reading B`

-- Reading A (the default) reads "on any premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person" as qualifying both "operate" and "have"; reading B reads it as qualifying only "have".
-- The three facts are asked separately: whether the person operates it, whether the person has it, and whether the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person.
`operates it away from own premises` MEANS `Dealing with apparatus` WITH
    `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale` IS FALSE
    `operates it` IS TRUE
    `has it` IS FALSE
    `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person` IS FALSE
    `broadcasting services are received on or by it` IS TRUE

`has it away from own premises` MEANS `Dealing with apparatus` WITH
    `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale` IS FALSE
    `operates it` IS FALSE
    `has it` IS TRUE
    `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person` IS FALSE
    `broadcasting services are received on or by it` IS TRUE

`operates it on own premises` MEANS `Dealing with apparatus` WITH
    `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale` IS FALSE
    `operates it` IS TRUE
    `has it` IS FALSE
    `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person` IS TRUE
    `broadcasting services are received on or by it` IS TRUE

-- operating it away from own premises: outside paragraph (c) on reading A, inside it on reading B
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(c) the person operates, or has on premises owned or occupied by the person, broadcasting apparatus on or by which broadcasting services are received, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(c) the person operates broadcasting apparatus, or has it on premises owned or occupied by the person, and broadcasting services are received, on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the dealing is within paragraph (a), (b) or (c) of the subsection, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the dealing is within paragraph (a), (b) or (c) of the subsection, on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- having it away from own premises: outside paragraph (c) on both readings
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(c) the person operates, or has on premises owned or occupied by the person, broadcasting apparatus on or by which broadcasting services are received, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `has it away from own premises` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(c) the person operates broadcasting apparatus, or has it on premises owned or occupied by the person, and broadcasting services are received, on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `has it away from own premises` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `has it away from own premises` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- on own premises: inside on both readings
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(c) the person operates, or has on premises owned or occupied by the person, broadcasting apparatus on or by which broadcasting services are received, on` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it on own premises` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(c) the person operates broadcasting apparatus, or has it on premises owned or occupied by the person, and broadcasting services are received, on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it on own premises` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(c) the person operates broadcasting apparatus, or has it on premises owned or occupied by the person, and broadcasting services are received, on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `has it on own premises and services are received` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- reading B still needs broadcasting apparatus, a service received, and no licence or exemption
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(c) the person operates broadcasting apparatus, or has it on premises owned or occupied by the person, and broadcasting services are received, on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive but not directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1)(c) the person operates broadcasting apparatus, or has it on premises owned or occupied by the person, and broadcasting services are received, on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `has it on own premises but no service is received` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 1 6 2025) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the window of the deposited text
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 24 9 2024) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 4 11 2026) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on, reading B of F-BA-03` (Date 5 11 2026) `apparatus that can receive directly from a satellite` `operates it away from own premises` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

